                                        "entry_id": "6828c33f-da3d-3802-a311-ca425a6da3f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various tropical (Central and South) American vines of the genus Smilax, such as Smilax aspera, which have fragrant roots."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
